Package: ggmodel
Title: Plot Machine Learning Models with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Enrique", "Pérez Herrero",
    email = "eph.project1500@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Convenience functions to visualise machine learning models
    with 'ggplot2': the error rate by number of trees and the variable
    importance (mean decrease in accuracy and in Gini index) of
    'randomForest' classification models, and confusion matrices
    computed with 'caret'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EnriquePH/ggmodel
BugReports: https://github.com/EnriquePH/ggmodel/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grDevices,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    caret,
    randomForest,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
